          </select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="match-item">
          <div class="match-q"> He edited the art book <i>Involvement</i>.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">28</strong><select class="hm-select" id="practice_single_reading_46_28_" name="practice_single_reading_46_28" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 28">
            <option value="">— choose —</option>
            <option value="A">A</option><option value="B">B</option><option value="C">C</option><option value="D">D</option><option value="E">E</option><option value="F">F</option>
          </select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="match-item">
          <div class="match-q"> He designed the cover of <i>Melbourne: A Portrait</i>.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">29</strong><select class="hm-select" id="practice_single_reading_46_29_" name="practice_single_reading_46_29" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 29">
            <option value="">— choose —</option>
            <option value="A">A</option><option value="B">B</option><option value="C">C</option><option value="D">D</option><option value="E">E</option><option value="F">F</option>
          </select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="match-item">
          <div class="match-q"> His book on Zagreb inspired Strizic's <i>Melbourne: A Portrait</i>.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">30</strong><select class="hm-select" id="practice_single_reading_46_30_" name="practice_single_reading_46_30" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 30">
            <option value="">— choose —</option>
            <option value="A">A</option><option value="B">B</option><option value="C">C</option><option value="D">D</option><option value="E">E</option><option value="F">F</option>
          </select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="match-item">
          <div class="match-q"> He collaborated with Strizic to combine photochromes with infrared photography.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">31</strong><select class="hm-select" id="practice_single_reading_46_31_" name="practice_single_reading_46_31" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 31">
            <option value="">— choose —</option>
            <option value="A">A</option><option value="B">B</option><option value="C">C</option><option value="D">D</option><option value="E">E</option><option value="F">F</option>
          </select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="match-item">
          <div class="match-q"> He wrote the text for <i>Involvement</i>, which was considered pretentious.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">32</strong><select class="hm-select" id="practice_single_reading_46_32_" name="practice_single_reading_46_32" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 32">
