      <div class="q-section-hdr">
        <h3>Questions 33–37</h3>
        <p>Do the following statements agree with the claims of the writer in Reading Passage 3?<br><b>YES</b> if the statement agrees with the claims of the writer, <b>NO</b> if the statement contradicts the claims of the writer, <b>NOT GIVEN</b> if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tfng-block" id="tfng-block">
        <div class="tfng-item">
          <div class="tfng-q"> <i>2000 Weeks</i> and its accompanying photo-roman were successful with the public.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">33</strong><select name="practice_single_reading_46_33" id="practice_single_reading_46_33_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 33"><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option value="YES">YES</option><option value="NO">NO</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option></select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="tfng-item">
          <div class="tfng-q"> Strizic's portraits in <i>Involvement</i> were exhibited at the National Gallery of Victoria in 1968.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">34</strong><select name="practice_single_reading_46_34" id="practice_single_reading_46_34_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 34"><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option value="YES">YES</option><option value="NO">NO</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option></select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="tfng-item">
          <div class="tfng-q"> Strizic was one of the first to document the interactive artwork <i>Sculptron</i>.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">35</strong><select name="practice_single_reading_46_35" id="practice_single_reading_46_35_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 35"><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option value="YES">YES</option><option value="NO">NO</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option></select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="tfng-item">
          <div class="tfng-q"> Strizic's photographic murals were produced with the help of advanced digital technology.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">36</strong><select name="practice_single_reading_46_36" id="practice_single_reading_46_36_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 36"><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option value="YES">YES</option><option value="NO">NO</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option></select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="tfng-item">
          <div class="tfng-q"> Strizic is best remembered solely as a nostalgic photographer of Melbourne.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">37</strong><select name="practice_single_reading_46_37" id="practice_single_reading_46_37_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 37"><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option value="YES">YES</option><option value="NO">NO</option><option value="NOT GIVEN">NOT GIVEN</option></select></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-section-hdr">
        <h3>Questions 38–40</h3>
        <p>Match the events below with the correct date, A, B, C or D.<br><b>NB</b> You may use any letter more than once.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="list-headings-box">
        List of Dates
        <ol type="A">
          <li><b>A</b> 1961</li>
          <li><b>B</b> 1968</li>
          <li><b>C</b> 1970</li>
          <li><b>D</b> 1988</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="match-block" id="match-block-2">
        <div class="match-item">
          <div class="match-q"> <i>Melbourne: A Portrait</i> received the Book of the Year award.</div>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">38</strong><select class="hm-select" id="practice_single_reading_46_38_" name="practice_single_reading_46_38" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 38">
